# Every want this agent holds, asked of the DESIRE MODALITY alone — the store-side half of
# what `desires.rq` and `gap.rq` used to ask of one dataset (a-store-is-a-modality, #298).
#
# Three branches, three kinds of want, none of them joined to a reading HERE: the desires
# store holds what is pursued, the beliefs store holds what is, and the join is Python's —
# `readings.rq` is the other half, and the arithmetic that used to be repeated between two
# queries and the module now lives once, in `Region`. Measured before it was built (#296):
# the split answers the same rows 3x faster than the join it replaces.
#
# `$me` is substituted as ever. `$owed` stays a placeholder for the obligations graph — a
# debt is this agent's own, the pattern would match nothing in a default union of public
# graphs, and a graph IRI is an INSTANCE code may not name. Run with the union default
# against the desires store; the region patterns stay UNQUALIFIED for the reason gap.rq
# always gave — desire is a CLASS of graph, and a second source must be readable unasked.
#
# ?side and the urgency arithmetic left this text when the dataset split, and the distance
# half never came back: how badly a stake is unmet is a capability's answer now
# (a-desire-states-its-own-measure), asked through the choir of whichever world is being
# judged — sensing's declaration for observation-backed wants. Staleness and lapse stay with
# whoever holds the clock, and a duty's fraction stays Python's while the engine will not
# divide durations.

SELECT ?kind ?desire ?property ?low ?high ?floor ?ceiling ?instrument
       ?owedTo ?claim ?presented ?at ?expires WHERE {
  {
    #  The desire is a NODE and the met-shape hangs off it (a-desire-states-its-own-measure) —
    #  the region's numbers are read through `ag:metWhen`. No measure rides out: how badly a
    #  want is unmet is a capability's answer, asked through the choir, not a column here.
    $me ag:holds ?desire .
    ?desire ssn:forProperty ?property ; ag:metWhen ?met .
    ?met sh:property ?below , ?above .
    ?below sh:severity ag:ShouldBecome ; ag:violationIs ag:Below ;
           sh:qualifiedValueShape/sh:property/sh:maxExclusive ?low .
    ?above sh:severity ag:ShouldBecome ; ag:violationIs ag:Above ;
           sh:qualifiedValueShape/sh:property/sh:minExclusive ?high .
    OPTIONAL { $me ag:holds ?envelope .
               ?envelope ssn:forProperty ?property ; sh:property ?underFloor , ?overCeiling .
               ?underFloor sh:severity sh:Warning ; ag:violationIs ag:Below ;
                           sh:qualifiedValueShape/sh:property/sh:maxExclusive ?floor .
               ?overCeiling sh:severity sh:Warning ; ag:violationIs ag:Above ;
                            sh:qualifiedValueShape/sh:property/sh:minExclusive ?ceiling }
    BIND("stake" AS ?kind)
  }
  UNION
  {
    #  KNOWING, which is a want in its own right and not a mood the region want is in. The
    #  loner's gardener watches a water butt it does not act for and still wants that reading
    #  current; fern acts for a pot AND wants its probe to have spoken recently, and those are
    #  two things it can be short of independently.
    #
    #  This used to be guarded — freshness only where no region answered for the property —
    #  because the region want carried the epistemic states itself and one property arriving
    #  as two desires would have been the same want twice. That reading survives on the region
    #  (unmeasured and stale are still its states, and still maximal), but it was never the
    #  thing a lever repairs: the deliberator answered both by a hardcoded OBSERVE that ran
    #  before any search, so nothing ever had to say WHICH want looking was for. With that
    #  gone the guard would have left a stale-but-in-range reading with no want anything
    #  points at — the region shape does not test age — and the agent would have stopped
    #  looking, quietly. One instrument, one want about it.
    #
    #  Which subject the instrument watches is the belief side's to say. ONE row per want:
    #  the premise is the sensor and only the sensor, which is what sensing's derivation
    #  writes — it carried the subject too, and every freshness want then arrived twice, the
    #  second copy keyed on a subject no instruments table has and so permanently unmeasured.
    $me ag:holds ?desire .
    ?desire ag:violationIs ag:Stale ; ssn:forProperty ?property ;
            prov:wasDerivedFrom ?instrument .
    BIND("freshness" AS ?kind)
  }
  UNION
  {
    GRAPH $owed {
      ?desire a ag:Obligation ; ag:owedTo ?owedTo ; ag:forClaim ?claim ;
            ag:presented ?presented ; ag:owedAt ?at .
      OPTIONAL { ?desire ag:expiresAt ?expires }
      #  A paid debt is HISTORY, not a desire — the ledger keeps every one, and `owed()` is
      #  where to ask about them.
      FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?desire ag:dischargedAt ?paid } }
    BIND("duty" AS ?kind)
  }
}
